{"Title":"An Act relative to the Hall-Whitaker Bridge","BillNumber":"H3400","DocketNumber":"HD2123","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JAP1","Name":"Jerald A. Parisella","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T11:58:49.35"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JAP1","Name":"Jerald A. Parisella","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T11:58:49.35"},{"Id":"JBL0","Name":"Joan B. Lovely","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JBL0","ResponseDate":"2023-06-30T11:49:30.25"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3400/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Parisella of Beverly, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3400) of Jerald A. Parisella relative to the Hall-Whitaker Bridge in the city of Beverly.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, any agency of the commonwealth that receives an application from the Department of Transportation relating to the construction and/or replacement of the Hall-Whitaker Bridge, located in the city of Beverly, must render a decision on such application within sixty days of the receipt of the application.\r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}